{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114356","id":3131659546,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66qVUa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114356","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114356.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114356.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114356","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114356/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114356/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114356/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/84742563f8bcbd525d8accbc2c05b46a6bc5ada0","number":114356,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix setting mesh blend shape properties in dummy mesh storage","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nWhen using the dummy rendering server, `ImporterMesh::add_surface()` fails if the mesh has blend shapes:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Condition \"blend_shape_count != (uint32_t)mesh_get_blend_shape_count(p_mesh)\" is true. Returning: Array()\r\n\tat: mesh_surface_get_blend_shape_arrays (servers/rendering_server.cpp:1774)\r\nERROR: Condition \"p_blend_shapes.size() != blend_shapes.size()\" is true.\r\n\tat: add_surface (scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp:68)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis causes various things, like the scene importers, to produce inaccurate scenes when running headless.\r\n\r\nThis is caused by the dummy mesh storage not actually setting and getting the blend_shape_count/blend_shape_mode. Implementing those fixes the issue.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/m